{"step_index":177,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-14T00:29:35Z","input_tokens":2288,"cache_read_tokens":306235,"output_tokens":2197,"thinking":"A clear overview of the dataset is now available. The file contains 3,978 companies. 730 companies (18.4%) already have phone numbers listed, while 3,248 (81.6%) are missing this information. 156 phone numbers have been found already in the initial part of the file (rows 1-799).\n\n\nAddressing the 3,248 missing phone numbers involves three phases: immediately integrate the 156 found in `step1_results.json`, then execute a bulk asynchronous query on a business directory for the remaining companies. The final step involves merging the retrieved data with the original dataset and saving both a text and Excel file to the specified location.\n\nA script will be developed for safe, large-scale lookups. Considering the directory's request limitations, the script will limit concurrent requests, add delays between calls, and implement intermediate saving every twenty processed entries to ensure continuity in case of interruption. This approach aims to achieve a processing rate of approximately 10-12 lookups per second, estimating a total processing time of roughly 4-5 minutes for the entire dataset. Further, this script will apply data cleansing rules, including invalid nationwide number prefix filtering, unwanted keyword removal, Korean phone number format verification, and Busan area code preference.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"const fs = require('fs');\\n\\nfunction isValidKoreanPhone(phone) {\\n  if (!phone) return false;\\n  const p = phone.trim().replace(/[^0-9\\\\-]/g, '');\\n  \\n  const regex = /^(02|03[1-3]|04[1-4]|05[1-5]|06[1-4]|070|01[016789])-[0-9]{3,4}-[0-9]{4}$|^(15[0-9]{2}|16[0-9]{2}|18[0-9]{2})-[0-9]{4}$|^(050[0-9]?)-[0-9]{3,4}-[0-9]{4}$/;\\n  if (!regex.test(p)) return false;\\n\\n  // 사업자번호 패턴(3-2-5 형식) 방지\\n  if (/^[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{5}$/.test(p)) return false;\\n  if (p === '02-1577-0000' || p === '1577-0000') return false;\\n  \\n  return true;\\n}\\n\\nfunction cleanPhonePrefix(phone) {\\n  if (!phone) return '';\\n  // 02-15xx, 02-16xx, 051-16xx\\n  const m = phone.match(/^(?:02|051|031)-(1[568][0-9]{2}-[0-9]{4})$/);\\n  if (m) return m[1];\\n  return phone;\\n}\\n\\nasync function fetchBizno(bizNo) {\\n  const clean = bizNo.replace(/[^0-9]/g, '');\\n  if (clean.length !== 10) return null;\\n\\n  const url = 'https://bizno.net/article/' + clean;\\n  try {\\n    const res = await fetch(url, {\\n      headers: {\\n        'User-Agent': 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/120.0.0.0 Safari/537.36'\\n      }\\n    });\\n    if (!res.ok) return null;\\n    const html = await res.text();\\n\\n    const thMatch = html.match(/<th>전화번호<\\\\/th>\\\\s*<td[^>]*>([\\\\s\\\\S]*?)<\\\\/td>/i);\\n    if (thMatch) {\\n      const inner = thMatch[1];\\n      if (inner.includes('세무서')) return null;\\n\\n      const telMatch = inner.match(/<a href=['\\\"]tel:([^'\\\"]+)['\\\"]/) || inner.match(/([0-9]{2,4}-[0-9]{3,4}-[0-9]{4}|1[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{4})/);\\n      if (telMatch) {\\n        let candidate = telMatch[1].trim();\\n        candidate = cleanPhonePrefix(candidate);\\n        if (isValidKoreanPhone(candidate)) {\\n          return candidate;\\n        }\\n      }\\n    }\\n  } catch (e) {\\n    // network error\\n  }\\n  return null;\\n}\\n\\nasync function runFullBatch() {\\n  const targets = JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync('cretap_missing_phone_targets.json', 'utf8'));\\n  console.log(`Starting Full Batch check for ${ta\n<truncated 2000 bytes>","Description":"\"Batch script for full cretap dataset\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\lg\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\worktrees\\\\resilient-bardeen\\\\find_company_phone_numbers\\\\full_cretap_batch.js\"","toolAction":"\"Writing full batch script\"","toolSummary":"\"Write full_cretap